{
  "name": "dsh4rcs",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "RCS 战队的 DeepSeek Harness 插件套件",
  "workspaces": [
    "packages/*"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "check": "node packages/rcs-core/src/cli.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.base.json --noEmit",
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "verify": "npm run typecheck && npm run build && npm run test",
    "dsh": "node scripts/dsh.mjs",
    "dsh:config": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile rcs-dev --dump-config",
    "dsh:start": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile rcs-dev",
    "dsh:start:rcs": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile rcs-dev",
    "dsh:start:no-rcs": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile rcs-dev --patch ./dsh4rcs-disabled.cordis.yml",
    "dsh:start:competition": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile rcs-dev --patch ./dsh4rcs-competition.cordis.yml",
    "dsh:install": "node scripts/install-plugins.mjs",
    "dsh:uninstall": "node scripts/dsh.mjs plugin --profile rcs-dev remove dsh-rcs-core dsh-rcs-guard dsh-rcs-rules dsh-rcs-control dsh-rcs-kb dsh-rcs-ui-client dsh-rcs-train",
    "dsh:patch": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile web --patch ./dev.cordis.yml",
    "dsh:patch:config": "node scripts/dsh.mjs --profile web --dump-config --patch ./dev.cordis.yml",
    "rules:import": "node scripts/docx-to-rules.mjs",
    "feishu:check": "node scripts/feishu-check.mjs",
    "kb:sync": "node scripts/kb-sync.mjs",
    "kb:dry": "node scripts/kb-sync.mjs --dry",
    "setup": "node scripts/setup.mjs",
    "postinstall": "node scripts/link-host-packages.mjs --postinstall"
  },
  "$scriptsComment": [
    "全部经 scripts/dsh.mjs 调用，它锁定 0.1.0-rc.6 并绕开 dsh-launcher。",
    "launcher（AppData\\Local\\Programs\\dsh-launcher）是 `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web %*`：",
    "  1. 不锁版本，会自己漂到新版；2. 硬编码 web 子命令，导致 `dsh plugin add` 彻底失效。",
    "",
    "dsh:start / dsh:config —— 用装好的 rcs-dev profile（日常用这个）",
    "dsh:start:rcs / dsh:start:no-rcs —— 启用或关闭整套 dsh4rcs（切换需重启 dsh）",
    "dsh:start:competition —— 关掉培训工具（rcs_train_*），其余照常。培训与比赛的差别只在工具集，",
    "dsh:uninstall —— 从 rcs-dev profile 卸载全部 7 个插件（profile 本身保留）。只卸一个就直接 `node scripts/dsh.mjs plugin --profile rcs-dev remove <包名>`。",
    "                         危险度判定不因此改变 —— 培训一样要烧代码、也用 F407。",
    "dsh:install          —— 重新构建并装进 rcs-dev profile（改了代码后跑）",
    "kb:sync / kb:dry      —— 不启动 dsh 直接同步飞书资料；--dry 只遍历不抓正文，先看范围对不对",
    "dsh:patch            —— 用 --patch overlay 挂到 web profile（临时调试用，不改 profile）",
    "",
    "换 dsh 版本前请重跑 npm run verify。",
    "dsh:install —— 走 scripts/install-plugins.mjs：构建 → 建 profile → 写版本 overrides → 装插件。中间那步不能省，缺了 pnpm 会把前端解析到比服务端更新的一代，网页端静默停在 Loading plugins。"
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": "0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.1",
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "typescript": "^5.7.0",
    "vitest": "^2.1.0"
  },
  "$depsComment": "三个 @deepseek-ai 包**精确锁版本**（无 ^）：它们只用于 typecheck 与外置解析，版本必须与运行时 dsh 一致，否则类型与实现会对不上。",
  "$overridesComment": [
    "各插件把这三个包声明为 peerDependencies 且范围是 \"*\" —— 运行时确实由宿主提供，写死范围会让装进 profile 时报 peer 冲突。",
    "但 npm 7+ 会自动安装 peer，\"*\" 于是解析到 npm 上的最新版并提升到根，把上面 devDependencies 的精确锁版本顶掉。",
    "实际踩到过：本机装成 dsh-tools 0.1.1-rc.2 / cordis 4.0.2，而运行时是 0.1.0-rc.6 —— typecheck 对着的 .d.ts 与真正加载的实现不是一个版本，且宿主包联接会因版本不一致而拒绝建立，双实例风险一直没消。",
    "overrides 在一处把整棵树钉死，插件那边的 \"*\" 保持不动。"
  ],
